dzll-launcher (0.5.0~b0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Refresh the rows actually visible in the server browser after scrolling.
  * Add a server browser status bar with a news ticker.
  * Server Companion: verify restart cycles, follow time changes, and allow
    learning data to be deleted.
  * Move Server Companion persistence and learning rebuilds off the GTK
    thread.
  * Build one package for Ubuntu 24.04, Ubuntu 26.04 and Debian 13: stop
    dh_python3 treating libsteam_api.so as a CPython extension, declare
    python3 (>= 3.12) and GTK 4.14, and depend on librsvg2-common.

